THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. The project uses only the standard libraries of .NET Framework 4.8 (for
example System, System.Core and System.Web.Extensions, the last one for JSON
serialization).

The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open specification published by
Anthropic; here it is implemented from scratch, without using its code.

